{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fully erotic, suspenseful, and romantic love game featuring older, beautiful tops and strong bottoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist can have a custom name, and the main bottom's perspective is the main bottom. Both BL and GB routes are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 6 possible targets: 4 older men (note the age difference), 1 male of the same age, and 1 beautiful female top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, the game includes the fully voiced prologue and first chapter, as well as a non-dubbed version of the second chapter.\uff08The new character image is updating\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083250/extras/steam\u5e93\u5f62\u8c61\u56fe\u7247__920_x_430_\u50cf\u7d20___1_?t=1768441187\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether lovers or enemies, they all want to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This seems to be closely related to your amnesia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been invited to the Stean Manor, owned by Elti, to discover your true self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what about ghosts?!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You scoff, saying there are no such things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And who is the main guest at this dinner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014